[1m== Step 2 of 4 - workers[0m
[90m  Each agent CLI below can run tasks. brigada offers every model the CLI[0m
[90m  knows: for each task the foreman says how heavy a model it needs (light,[0m
[90m  standard, heavy) and how hard it should think, and brigada picks the[0m
[90m  model of that tier with the best record on this repo. Reviews always go[0m
[90m  to a different model family than the author's, so you need at least two[0m
[90m  families (e.g. claude + codex).[0m

